{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-08_end","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-08","title":"雷聲轟鳴","storyCode":"9-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"bd9e6b31835f5dbba51fa1c96862ee784543e56387e37a4e36d79f774093df6c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然來了，就都出來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的人怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"您的屬下在這裡。放心，他們只是暈了過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的不是大提琴他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我指的是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別逼我，否則的話，抵著你下巴的就不是我的盾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......要是您拔劍的話，您就是在襲擊同僚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，同僚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我們進入小丘郡的那一刻起，你們何曾把我們當成同僚？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......您......在這裡切斷我的喉管......您也不能改變......上校的決定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的沒有聽說過風暴突擊隊的戰士能做到什麼程度，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三角鐵讓你們損失了多少人？半支連隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡只有我一個。但是，我向你保證，你不會想知道我搞定你們需要花多少時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你放下武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，我......我們這就殺了她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大提琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我說真的！你敢動一下，我的弩立刻射穿她的脖子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們贏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"制服她！快上，一起上，不能讓她再碰到盾和劍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希爾......你告訴漢密爾頓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞以他為恥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"......上校並不需要維多利亞的感激。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"資料都整理好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女士，都在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利弗，我注意到你也發完電訊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"合作企業都收到了通知。根據協定條款，之後他們會去找附近其他城市的辦事處，或者終止合約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這麼看，我們的損失還不小啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰亂中蒙受損失的企業不止羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，沒辦法，就是我看著這些桌子椅子實在心裡難受。當年我剛來小丘郡的時候，我們這間屋子還是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利弗，陷在離別之愁裡還為時過早，你又怎麼知道我們不會馬上回來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的沒錯。唉，希望很快這座城市又能恢復往日的平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......倉庫裡的藥，清點結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你們把這些藥分一分，確保每個人都能帶上足量的應急藥品，直到大家順利轉移至最近的辦事處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣分完，還剩下很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"全帶走的話會有些壓力，畢竟我們人沒那麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碎紙機，雖然你沉默依舊，但我看得出來，你有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......城裡的人們，需要藥品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好，我也這麼認為。一旦戰火蔓延開，各項基礎補給都會告急，尤其是需要長期服用的礦石病鎮痛和抑制藥物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你應該有附近醫院的名單吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經整理好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想辦法給他們送過去。無論這些機構為誰服務，都要儘量送到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，別忘記那些開在巷子裡的小診所，它們大多沒有招牌，可我們相當多的當地朋友們全指望它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，這樣真的妥當嗎？我們一般並不直接越過當地藥企，給醫療機構和個人提供藥品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常時期，非常舉措。更何況，不會有多少醫院拒絕來自熱心市民的“匿名捐贈”吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"確實！原來您都想好了啊。可是我們誰負責去送呢？附近的人們都知道我們是羅德島的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我去。我會幫助碎紙機大哥打包藥品，然後我來送藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡，你好些了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口不再流血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我問的不是傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都在忙碌的時候，我不想一個人躲在一旁哭泣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你幫忙當然是好事，不過，藥可不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信瓦伊凡的體能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不希望羅德島的任務耽誤你自己的計畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。從這裡到交戰區，剛好能路過好幾家醫院和診所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等送完藥，我就會歸隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還差一點，很快打包就能完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那大家也差不多該上路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Outcast說著，從身側的武器袋中拔出了一把左輪手銃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這就是您的銃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對薩科塔來說，行動之前，總要填好子彈才算準備萬全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"您的彈倉好像沒滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通常情況下，同時射出五發子彈也夠用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我在回本艦和巴蒂他們吃飯的時候，聽過很多您的外勤故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾經用一發子彈幹掉過三個哥倫比亞匪首，用三發子彈打散過一支雇傭兵隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，沒什麼敵人值得您連開六槍吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可未必。畢竟，更大的挑戰永遠在前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我答應過一個人，我不會輕易射出六發子彈——因為我們打了一個賭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忍不住好奇，什麼樣的賭約會讓您這樣的人改變行事方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解釋起來會有那麼一點複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我的那位朋友想方設法地要讓我舒舒服服地享受退休生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我總是有一種預感，像我這樣的人，即便哪一天真的退休了，也沒法過得太平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒想到小丘郡會變得這麼不平靜，明明幾十個小時前，我們還聚在一起打牌喝茶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多時候，局勢就如同天色，總是瞬息萬變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能選擇的話，我還是希望這次撤退行動能平靜些，最好連一顆子彈都用不上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......女士，都準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友們，是時候說再見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員奧利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"小簡妮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必這麼難過，奧利弗叔叔，我相信Outcast的話——我們一定還能再見面的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"簡，小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的，碎紙機大哥。你們也是，務必保全自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我是不是聽見了雷聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......馬上就要下雨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這個聲音不大對勁。簡，你先別出門！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"廚子先生，廚子先生你在嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，我在，我在的！別拍門啦，我們這辦公室的門被油煙燻久了，可不經敲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還在就好......是這樣的，我要找信使，我們有重要的消息要傳出城去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我都明白。剛好，我也有東西要交給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這是什麼？一張......紙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是一名駐軍軍官——叫路易士·凱利的那位，他剛剛交給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱利上尉？他怎麼會跟你聯絡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，他壓根不知道我是誰，只不過因為我是他最後撞見的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來是去周圍打探消息，畢竟我記得自己的老本行是吧......沒想到我竟然遇上了駐軍在抓他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓......他？你的意思是，凱利上尉被自己人抓了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說他窩藏礦石病人！可這不對啊，他兒子幾個月前因為礦石病去世，城裡的人都知道，他第一時間就上報了他兒子生病的消息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群人......拿這麼悲慘的疾病當藉口？太無恥了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是一次兩次了，對想把各種歧視擺上檯面的人來說，礦石病真是一個特別好用的幌子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這次，駐軍是為了清理內部塔拉出身的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是軍官還是士兵，只要家裡和塔拉人沾親帶故，都在一夜之間被剝奪了自由行動的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清理軍隊內部的塔拉人？在急需用人的戰時？我有一些很不好的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，凱利上尉拼命塞給我這張紙，想讓我交給“最近一直在附近晃悠的不是駐軍的士兵”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廚子先生，這是駐軍在製造非法源石武器的證據！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！漢密爾頓是瘋了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你找到可信的信使，把這張紙和我們關於鬼魂部隊的報告放在一起，作為重要情報，立刻帶出小丘郡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是上尉在最後關頭的努力，我們一定不能白費！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這些消息太重要了，民間信使並不牢靠。這樣吧，女士，我自己跑這趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廚子先生，您也當過信使嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，傳遞消息也是我們點燈人老本行的一部分。哎，我這總算能接點像樣的任務了，我的手跟腿都在興奮地發抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦等下，外面有什麼聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是在打雷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得不太像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我在小丘郡待了這麼多年，這天氣說變就變，我都習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這點雷雨還攔不住我，我走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這不是打雷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，廚子先生——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這是炮轟聲！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["幹員奧利弗","幹員碎紙機"]}]}
